From f9f37122d8fead8af3df6263b16e07a666077d22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ndamathia <47696354+OliverSolomon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 06:53:25 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Host controls: ribbon tabs, Viewing mode, turned-off
 commands, font box sections, comment click

- UiState::hidden_tabs: an embedding host chooses which ribbon tabs show
  (hiding File also closes the File view).
- Word's Editing / Reviewing / Viewing switch: Viewing (Session::viewing)
  refuses every command that changes the document except File ones.
- Session::disabled_commands: commands a host turned off (ids or prefix*),
  greyed in the ribbon and refused by Session::run and WordApp::execute.
- Font box: Theme Fonts, Recently Used Fonts (remembered in UiState) and All
  Fonts sections, as in Word; WordApp::cloud_fonts lists fonts the host can
  fetch on demand, picked ones queue in font_requests, fonts_changed relayouts.
- Clicking a comment card in the Comments pane goes to the text it's about.
---
